by Folio for Immich: https://github.com/Rtx-9/folio-for-immich. The Svelte composer
and viewer are implemented within ImmichPager's existing authorization model.

The rich-text editor uses Tiptap and ProseMirror packages distributed under their
MIT licenses. See the installed packages for their copyright and license notices:
https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap and https://github.com/ProseMirror.

